cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this simulator, please cite it with its version and the model version of your runs."
title: "NRMP Simulations: a simulator of the residency Match"
abstract: >-
  An open-source simulator of the residency Match: applicants and residency programs with preferences and imperfect
  information go through applications, preference signals, interview invitations, interviews and rank order lists
  to applicant-proposing deferred acceptance. Runs are reproducible from their parameters and seed and record the
  model and engine versions they used. Independent; not affiliated with the National Resident Matching Program.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Davis
    given-names: Vincent
repository-code: "https://github.com/vincentdavis/NRMP_Simulated"
url: "https://nrmp-simulated.heteroskedastic.org"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - residency match
  - NRMP
  - deferred acceptance
  - matching markets
  - simulation
